ncz-screensavers (0.6.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The nine remaining OpenGL 1 classics (voronoi, gravitywell, hexstrut, cubestorm,
    crackberg, cityflow, noof, geodesic, gibson) are native GLES3 shader-engine ports
    with retained buffers and instancing (classic and enhanced styles, options per
    hack); cityflow no longer renders as flat polygons.
  * hypertorus, klein and projectiveplane lose their fixed-function fallback.
  * The GL1 immediate-mode layer, gl4es support and every hack not in the ship set
    (Black Hole, hyprsaver, xshadertoy, the twelve classics) are removed from the source
    tree and the package.

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:30:00 +0000

ncz-screensavers (0.5.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * GPU classes: NCZ_GPU_CLASS (weak, mid, strong) or inferred from
    GL_RENDERER; weak GPUs (Intel UHD) start at render scale 0.5 and Black Hole
    drops bloom and halves nebula and star density. All presets declare
    min-gpu-class and measured fps (presets.tsv columns 8 and 9).
  * NCZ_ALLOW_SOFTWARE_FALLBACK accepted as an alias (only without a GPU).

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:00:00 +0000

ncz-screensavers (0.5.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * render-hints.tsv: per-hack render scale (measured on Mali-G720) for the
    shader hacks that miss 45 fps at native 1080p; render scale measurements
    documented.

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 22:00:00 +0000

ncz-screensavers (0.5.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Black Hole shader: remove three spec-undefined GLSL operations (pow of a
    negative base, smoothstep with reversed edges, normalize of a zero
    vector); no change in the rendered image.
  * Harness: the Mali and integrated-Intel render-height cap now uses the
    GL_RENDERER string captured at startup.
  * Docs: palette distinctness on Mali, preset screenshots, shader hack guide.

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 21:00:00 +0000

ncz-screensavers (0.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Black Hole presets: sagittarius-a-star, m87-star, ton-618, quasar,
    quasar-edge-on, blazar, microquasar, kerr (faithful or artistic labels);
    each is also a catalog row (presets.tsv) launching --preset=<id>.
    New options: preset, disk-outer, jet-length, torus, companion; new eht
    palette; --list-presets and --print-config.
  * Render scale ladder ends at 0.35; docs: shader hack guide, scenes design.

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:00:00 +0000

ncz-screensavers (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Black Hole: configurable through one option table (command line,
    NCZ_BLACKHOLE_<OPTION>, blackhole.conf): 26 options, three new palettes
    (singularity, slingshot, whitehole), eight camera flyby types, palette
    cycling with cross-fades, spin, bloom, exposure, beaming and more.
    Declarative option schema installed under share/ncz-screensavers/options.
  * Fix the once-per-second stutter: the diagnostic framebuffer readbacks in
    the harness, xshadertoy and transitions are now opt-in.
  * Shared harness: --help/--version/--list-options for every hack, unknown
    options are an error, render-scale and max-render-height (wp_viewport
    upscaling, Mali defaults to 1080p), adaptive scale, per-run [stats] line.
  * Refuse to software render on a machine that has a GPU (exit 3).
  * Black Hole adaptive ray-step quality that converges without oscillating.

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:00:00 +0000

