ncz-screensavers (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Consolidated ship set of 84 hacks (Black Hole, 35 hyprsaver, 36
    xshadertoy, 12 classics) with install rules and chooser catalog.
  * Black Hole: restore stylized/kipthorne/faithful color modes selected with
    NCZ_BLACKHOLE_COLORS; replace the screen-space jet cone (large-dots
    searchlight artifact) with collimated beams.
  * Add the dev.ncz.screensaver GSettings schema with blackhole-color-mode.

